messages.content:
Read the India GST invoice text and reply with one JSON object that follows this JSON schema exactly:
{
  "$defs": {
    "ExtractedField": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One field: the value, the model's confidence, and the supporting quote.",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Value"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Confidence",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "citation": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Citation"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "title": "ExtractedField",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "The strict schema the extraction model must return.",
  "properties": {
    "supplier_name": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "supplier_gstin": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "invoice_number": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "invoice_date": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "taxable_amount": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "cgst": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "sgst": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "igst": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "total": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "hsn_sac": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "po_reference": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "due_date": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "currency": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "supplier_name",
    "supplier_gstin",
    "invoice_number",
    "invoice_date",
    "taxable_amount",
    "cgst",
    "sgst",
    "igst",
    "total",
    "hsn_sac",
    "po_reference",
    "due_date",
    "currency"
  ],
  "title": "IndiaInvoiceFields",
  "type": "object"
}
Rules:
- Read only what the document shows. Never guess a value.
- Every field has "value", "confidence" (0 to 1), and "citation".
- "citation" must be the exact line from the invoice that supports the value, copied character for character. Use null when there is no value.
- Required fields: supplier_name, supplier_gstin, invoice_number, invoice_date, taxable_amount, total, currency. Use null only when the document does not show the field at all.
- Amounts are digits, commas, and a decimal point only, for example "10,000.00", with no currency symbol or code.
- Dates are copied as printed, for example "05/09/2026".
- cgst, sgst, and igst are the tax amounts, not the tax rates. Use null for a component the invoice does not charge.
- hsn_sac and po_reference are the identifiers printed on the invoice, or null when the invoice does not cite one.
- currency is the ISO code, for example "INR".

Invoice text:
TAX INVOICE
Supplier: Paper Trail Supplies Pvt Ltd
GSTIN: 29AABCV1234C1ZQ
Invoice number: PTS/2026/0147
Invoice date: 05/09/2026
Due date: 05/10/2026
Purchase order: PO-IN-2001
HSN/SAC: 4820
Taxable amount: 10,000.00
CGST 9%: 900.00
SGST 9%: 900.00
IGST: 0.00
Total: 11,800.00 INR
